      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the frame lag represents how many \"cpu side\" frames we\u0027ve produced. So in this case of 3 we allow for 2 frames to be active on the GPU and one frame built on on the CPU. But we don\u0027t want to submit that next frame to the GPU yet until one of the others returns. So we\u0027ll only ever have 2 frames running on the GPU at a time and thus only 2 frames where\u0027re tracking the finish up.",
